   =20
 =20
  <p style=3D"margin: 16px 0;"><strong>Coding agents are the fastest-growin=
g use case on OpenRouter.</strong> One API key gives your agent access to e=
very model, with automatic provider fallback if one goes down. You stop mai=
ntaining four provider accounts and one consolidated usage view replaces fo=
ur separate dashboards.</p>
